https://adobe-type-tools.github.io/font-tech-notes/pdfs/5176.CFF.pdf

Adobe Glyph List and ITC Zapf Dingbats Glyph List
----------------------------------------------

Source: https://github.com/adobe-type-tools/agl-aglfn
Authoritative local inputs: scripts/data/glyphlist.txt and
scripts/data/zapfdingbats.txt, including their table-version, date, and legal
headers. scripts/sync_glyphlist_sources.py refreshes from upstream master
without recording an immutable upstream commit.
Relationship and outputs: the retained lists supply Unicode assignments for
fontdata/glyphlist_generated.go, fontdata/symbol_encoding_generated.go,
fontdata/zapfdingbats_encoding_generated.go, and
fontdata/standard_metrics_generated.go through the respective generators.
The Symbol mapping preserves the Adobe assignments for mu (U+00B5), Delta
(U+2206), and Omega (U+2126); related AFM inputs are described below.
License: BSD-3-Clause. Full terms: THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES, "Adobe Glyph List and
ITC Zapf Dingbats Glyph List license", and the retained source headers.

